    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68685" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μονό-τροπος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>living alone,
			solitary</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεανίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					281
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ps.</u>
				67(68).6
			</span></i>: title of plays by Phrynichus, Anaxilas, and Ophelio; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφιλοι καὶ ἄμικτοι καὶ μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.479c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Ir.</u>
					p.49
				</span></i>
			 W., <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.551
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pel.</u>
				3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. λῃστής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					2.21.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ζῷα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					<u>UP</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of one kind</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁπλαῖ καὶ μ. ἡδοναί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.662a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. λέξις</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποικίλη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
			</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.8
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πως</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				5.10.4
			</span></i>.</div>
